# Git push

One GitHub repo for both apps: `https://github.com/khutayant/hlu.git`

| Local folder | Branch |
|--------------|--------|
| `hlu/` | `ui` |
| `hlu-server/` | `server` |

Do **not** use a separate `hlu-server` remote/repo.

## Commands

- **`git push`** (no branch named): push **both** branches (`ui` + `server`) to `khutayant/hlu`. Prefer `bash /Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/scripts/git-push-all.sh`.
- **`git push ui`**: push only `ui` from `hlu/` via `npm run git:push`.
- **`git push server`**: push only `server` from `hlu-server/` via `npm run git:push`.

## Before push

- Commit pending changes in each working tree that will be pushed.
- Both folders’ `origin` must be `https://github.com/khutayant/hlu.git`.
- Use PAT from `/Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/.github-pat` (never put the token in chat or in the remote URL).
- Do not print or log the PAT.

## After push — always show these tables

**Commit table**

| Branch | Commit Message |
|--------|----------------|
| ui / server | latest commit subject |

**Result**

| Branch | Message |
|--------|---------|
| ui / server | pushed ok / push failed / … |
